# Default: ignore all new/untracked paths under data/ (CLI output, local dumps, etc.).
# Version control is limited to this file. `input/` is listed without `!` (F2), so
# fixtures already in git history stay tracked; a new file under input/ needs `git add -f`.

*
!.gitignore

# input/ is ignored for *new* untracked files. See docs/dogfooding.md F2.
# Add !<dir>/ + !<dir>/** only when committing another top-level subtree.
input/
input/**

!comparison/
!comparison/**
